<div id="site-banner"
     class="info-blue-banner container-fluid sm-g-0"
     style="background-color:#D8292F; color:#fff;">

    <div class="content container-xl sm-g-0">
        <div style="align-content:center;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation fa-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
            B.C. has declared a state of provincial emergency due to regional wildfires.
            Find evacuation info at
            <a style="font-weight:700; color:#fff;"
               class="BANNER_NEWS"
               target="_blank"
               href="https://www.emergencyinfobc.gov.bc.ca/?utm_campaign=20230818_GCPE_AM_WILDFIRE_1_ALERT_WEB_BCGOV_EN_BC__NTFCTN_">EmergencyInfoBC.ca</a>.
            <br />For Emergency Support Services, visit
            <a style="font-weight:700; color:#fff;"
               class="BANNER_NEWS"
               target="_blank"
               href="https://ess.gov.bc.ca/">ess.gov.bc.ca</a>.
        </div>

        <div style="align-content:center;">
            <a id="btnCloseBanner" style="color:#fff;">
                <i class="fa fa-xmark fa-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>